1. Load experimenter-coded knowledge responses
1. Exclude pre-registered participants (corrupted data)
1. Flag trials exceeding missing-data threshold (>25%)
1. Compute dwell time per poster per trial (AOI collision)
1. Compute revisit count per poster per trial (AOI re-entries)
1. Compute knowledge scores (gist, eligibility, verbatim deviation)
1. Merge gaze and knowledge data
1. Export cleaned dataset + summary statistics

